{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人麥長青（麥包）近年成日見到佢現身各大電視台，大小節目、商演等均見到佢身影，已達57歲之齡嘅佢更係圈中顧家好男人，與太太林孜（Allison）結婚27年，育有一對仔女，大女麥淳琳（Shannon）26歲，細仔麥振瑋（Wayne）亦已24歲</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T10:23:54.624457+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T10:01:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T10:17:13.328549+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T10:17:13.328549+00:00","content_hash":"6cb54658a53e7f66057cb0bae87b4f21d4e1d195b4a55899a5f9b0be09cf9760","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}